o apply and will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin, genetics, disability, age, or veteran status. Requirements: Minimum Requirements: Doctoral degree in Nursing or Master of Science in Nursing with a doctoral degree in a related field* An unencumbered registered nurse license in the Commonwealth of Pennsylvania Master of Science in Nursing (MSN) is required Preferred Requirements: Experience with teaching didactic, clinical, and lab courses. Experience with nursing labs and/or simulation labs is preferred. *A candidate with an MSN will qualify for the rank of instructor. A candidate with an MSN and a doctorate will qualify for the rank of assistant professor Additional Information: Special Requirements Background check required after a conditional job offer is made. Consideration of the background check will be tailored to the requirements of the job. Application Instructions: Required Documents: Resume Cover Letter Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs) Powered by Hide Main Navigation Immaculata University 1145 KING ROAD IMMACULATA, PA. 19345"
